# Get a free key from https://aistudio.google.com/apikey (Google account
# required, no credit card). Free tier is generous enough for personal
# resume tailoring (roughly 250 requests/day on Gemini 2.5 Flash).
#
# Privacy note: Google's free tier terms generally allow your inputs to be
# used to improve their products. Your resume contains real personal
# details (name, contact info, work history) — read Google's Gemini API
# terms if that matters to you before uploading. Anthropic's paid API (an
# alternative backend this app has also run on) does not train on customer
# data by default; this app uses Gemini specifically for the free tier, and
# that privacy tradeoff is the cost of "free."
GEMINI_API_KEY=your-gemini-api-key-here
